erous wilderness filled with secrets waiting to be discovered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Vast open world to explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Hidden dungeons and ancient ruins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Dynamic weather and day-night cycles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Solo and cooperative exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Secrets scattered throughout the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/daf2d512f26e0c1d268befe258422ff0.webp?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/daf2d512f26e0c1d268befe258422ff0.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=31 /></span>                                                       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/69b38dcd55c9d2f5f7e8e61f8fc0a1eb.avif?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/69b38dcd55c9d2f5f7e8e61f8fc0a1eb.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=794 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Whether you're building a village, preparing for a raid, hunting dragons, or relaxing around the campfire, every adventure is better shared with friends.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Community-focused servers designed around cooperation, reputation, and long-term friendships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Guilds can build and expand villages together </strong><br><br><strong>• Group quests and cooperative progression </strong><br><br><strong>• Shared housing, businesses, and community projects </strong><br><br><strong>• Trade, socialize, and prepare for raids together </strong><br><br><strong>• A world large enough to explore, small enough to know your neighbors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/967a81f7abb6ef984742d00ec7cf0c8b.webp?t=1782723344\" width=1334 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/4dfda2bb34e9a2e09b80e985624ab3c5.avif?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/4dfda2bb34e9a2e09b80e985624ab3c5.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=797 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face powerful enemies designed to test teamwork, strategy, and skill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Venture into dangerous encounters solo or with friends, overcome unique boss mechanics, and earn valuable rewards that help define your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Cooperative raid content - 6-8 players </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Powerful bosses and unique encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Random rare loot and progression rewards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/3b66ecc261096f3a56036cfc88c32656.webp?t=1782723344\" width=1103 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/435e6d681745fa64f64c268044eee24d.avif?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/435e6d681745fa64f64c268044eee24d.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=797 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master distinct combat styles inspired by legendary factions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Templar Knight – Defender of the Order</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Viking Berserker – Master of brutal melee combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Viking Raider – Swift warrior and explorer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Druid – Wielder of nature's power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Inquisitor – Hunter of darkness and corruption</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Knight of the Round Table – Champion of Arthurian legend</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Morgan Le Fay – Deadly archer inspired by the legendary enchantress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/35274b300179c4ad7a784dad5713f4e8.webp?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/35274b300179c4ad7a784dad5713f4e8.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/383a383941eda376b45313765c9ef58d.avif?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/383a383941eda376b45313765c9ef58d.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=797 /></span>                                                </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take to the skies, fight enemies from above, and clash with other players in epic aerial PvP battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Find, collect, and trade rare dragon eggs</strong><br><strong>• Raise dragons from pets into companions and flying battle mounts </strong> <br><strong>• Command Fire, Ice, and Water dragons with unique powers </strong> <br><strong>• Fight enemies from the sky or enter aerial PvP battles </strong> <br><strong>• Dragon paths are tied to class, Fire for Inquisitors, Ice for Templars, and Water for Druids</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                             <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/83a950c168c6fc544d59f5feeb626f3c.webp?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/83a950c168c6fc544d59f5feeb626f3c.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/582911f40e6fa880495ae3dedbae310c.avif?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/582911f40e6fa880495ae3dedbae310c.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=797 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Establish your place within the world through homes, businesses, and community-driven progression.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a lasting presence as you expand your influence and contribute to the growth of the lands around you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player homes and properties</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Businesses and services - Stables, Forges, Mills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-driven progression</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Long-term ownership systems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/7487bf052f04fe1c5876a8d3cc7304c1.webp?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/7487bf052f04fe1c5876a8d3cc7304c1.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=35 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/4cfd6f5dd7d9d9eba7a3549492d09378.avif?t=1782723344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/4cfd6f5dd7d9d9eba7a3549492d09378.webp?t=1782723344 width=1560 height=797 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Serve the Templar Order or the Inquisition and earn your place among their ranks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Discover hidden treasures, relics, and long-forgotten secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Follow the trail of the Templars across a world inspired by real history and legend</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Uncover an alternate history filled with mysteries, conspiracies, and ancient knowledge</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas