aragraph\" ><strong>Take your time, enjoy the journey, and forge your own legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/ed6aefd522478f58010865b0b08b3190.webp?t=1782723344\" width=1015 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/d1b5d1988db72c26a1442597390a59df.poster.avif?t=1782723344\" width=1080 height=788 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/d1b5d1988db72c26a1442597390a59df.webm?t=1782723344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/d1b5d1988db72c26a1442597390a59df.mp4?t=1782723344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/0d10f3b8fb475807981caf4bc67de8f2.poster.avif?t=1782723344\" width=1080 height=788 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/0d10f3b8fb475807981caf4bc67de8f2.webm?t=1782723344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/0d10f3b8fb475807981caf4bc67de8f2.mp4?t=1782723344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b51e20ef5dee9283f282895c37f59b68.avif?t=1782723344\" data-bi